  "description": "The goal of the SUPREME DH V5 XS is clear: to allow smaller riders to benefit from the best technologies and to win races.\n• The ROCKSHOX BoXXer Ultimate fork is among the most efficient and ergonomic in terms of adjustments. Its forgiving chassis is perfectly suited to this model designed for lightweight riders. The Vivid Coil Ultimate DH shock provides increased sensitivity and optimal control on the most demanding terrain.\n• The TRP DH-R Evo 4-piston brakes with 223mm rotors are powerful and durable. They provide a progressive feel and precise braking.\n• SPANK Race 33 rims are perfect for riders looking for solid and reliable wheels.\n• The SRAM GX DH 7-speed drivetrain is designed for gravity use. It is responsive and robust.",
